# Upload filter for app deploys (the CLI packages the whole monorepo via the ephemeral
# root .vercel/repo.json; see scripts/vercel/README.md). Remote build installs fresh.
**/node_modules
**/.next
.git
.vercel
.claude
.turbo
.pnpm-store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
# Every local env file. Never upload .env.local or any other secret file.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
